            <ArticleTitle>One year in review 2016: fibromyalgia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S145-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Fibromyalgia (FM) syndrome is a chronic disease with unknown aetiology, characterised by widespread pain, fatigue and other functional symptoms. We reviewed the literature of the past year to underline the recent progress in the etiopathogenesis, assessment and therapies of this syndrome, evaluating the articles published between January 2015 and January 2016.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
